  "title": "Turkey Spinach Sweet Potato Casserole",
  "description": "Make this sweet potato casserole ahead of time for a satisfying breakfast with layers of turkey sausage, spinach, and seasoned egg whites.",
  "authors": [
    "Megan Olson"
  ],
